1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 39]</font>

15
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:20,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chengtian Sect]</font>

16
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, let's go.</font>

17
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's in the box?</font>

18
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:26,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move.</font>

19
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Corydalis tuber.</font>

20
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:36,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eupolyphaga sinensis.</font>

21
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Teasel root.</font>

22
00:01:38,360 --> 00:01:39,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just something for the pain.</font>

23
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:40,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing unusual.</font>

24
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard Lord Ruling</font>

25
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">prepped fireworks
for the sacred maid tonight.</font>

26
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:46,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good news is on the horizon.</font>

27
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:49,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Grandlord approved their union.</font>

28
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lord Ruling has
such a distinguished air.</font>

29
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:52,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He and the sacred maid
are a perfect match.</font>

30
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:11,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You dragged me out here</font>

31
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just to show me this surprise?</font>

32
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:17,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew it.</font>

33
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In this whole world,</font>

34
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">only you truly care about me.</font>

35
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, I care about you.</font>

36
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't understand.</font>

37
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:38,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why must you do all the work,</font>

38
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">while he reaps the rewards?</font>

39
00:02:42,320 --> 00:02:43,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suppose I'm just unlucky,</font>

40
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">born and raised</font>

41
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the Chengtian Sect.</font>

42
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Grandlord is a deity to us.</font>

43
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:52,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every word he speaks</font>

44
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:53,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a divine edict.</font>

45
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As the sacred maid,</font>

46
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I merely relay his commands.</font>

47
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:02,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be sad.</font>

48
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've prepared a surprise for you.</font>

49
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see what treasure it is.</font>

50
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Colorless and odorless.</font>

51
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji has no respect for me.</font>

52
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She still has the mood
to watch fireworks.</font>

53
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bring her and that Beiyuan man</font>

54
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to me at once.</font>

55
00:04:16,960 --> 00:04:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

56
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go fetch them at once.</font>

57
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:22,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji,</font>

58
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've been bewitched.</font>

59
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do not blame me.</font>

60
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Grandlord of the Sect</font>

61
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:33,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is actually a eunuch!</font>

62
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:41,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is...</font>

63
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qingzhi's tongue.</font>

64
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:44,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling!</font>

65
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you do this?</font>

66
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you say</font>

67
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that if she dared to speak ill</font>

68
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before the Grandlord,</font>

69
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you would cut out her tongue?</font>

70
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

71
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She caused you to be beaten.</font>

72
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was I wrong to do so?</font>

73
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:00,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady.</font>

74
00:05:00,520 --> 00:05:02,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Grandlord summons
you and Ruling back.</font>

75
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's over.</font>

76
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You go back first.</font>

77
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let him enter.</font>

78
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Regarding Qingzhi,</font>

79
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was about to inform you.</font>

80
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please punish me.</font>

81
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are the sacred maid of our sect.</font>

82
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:40,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could I ever punish you?</font>

83
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:43,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Fourth Prince
is confined in the hall.</font>

84
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His residence is under guard.</font>

85
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Great Emperor
lies gravely ill in bed.</font>

86
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of this is thanks to your efforts.</font>

87
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:51,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should be rewarding you.</font>

88
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All credit goes to your planning.</font>

89
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:56,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Serving you</font>

90
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is simply my duty.</font>

91
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please rise.</font>

92
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:00,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I dare not.</font>

93
00:06:01,840 --> 00:06:03,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please don't take it to heart</font>

94
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:04,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about what happened to Qingzhi.</font>

95
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:06,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for that,</font>

96
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you are not the one
who should be kneeling.</font>

97
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Grandlord,</font>

98
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling only did this</font>

99
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to defend me against an injustice.</font>

100
00:06:16,440 --> 00:06:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

101
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:18,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kneel now.</font>

102
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Beg the Grandlord's forgiveness.</font>

103
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why should I kneel to him?</font>

104
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, this is your ideal husband?</font>

105
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling spoke out of turn</font>

106
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:27,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and caused you displeasure.</font>

107
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I beg forgiveness on his behalf.</font>

108
00:06:30,960 --> 00:06:31,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

109
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:32,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kneel.</font>

110
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why must I kneel to him?</font>

111
00:06:38,840 --> 00:06:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji,</font>

112
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you have no need to fear him.</font>

113
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:46,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All these years,
you gave your all to the Sect.</font>

114
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:47,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And in the end,</font>

115
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he alone took all the credit.</font>

116
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:52,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I were you,</font>

117
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:55,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could never swallow such an insult.</font>

118
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:59,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such a Grandlord deserves no respect.</font>

119
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:02,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even without him,</font>

120
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:04,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll remain beloved</font>

121
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:05,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">by the people.</font>

122
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But without you,</font>

123
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'll be a worthless creature</font>

124
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who shuns the light.</font>

125
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dare you!</font>

126
00:07:15,200 --> 00:07:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling, hold your tongue!</font>

127
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:22,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji,</font>

128
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:24,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I offer you a chance.</font>

129
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him.</font>

130
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:32,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Grandlord,</font>

131
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:36,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling is the one I love most.</font>

132
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:39,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please spare our lives.</font>

133
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:41,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you refuse to act,</font>

134
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll send you both to hell</font>

135
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to be a pair of star-crossed lovers.</font>

136
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do not test my patience further.</font>

137
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do not forget:</font>

138
00:07:52,160 --> 00:07:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If not for me,</font>

139
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:55,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you would still be</font>

140
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:57,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">eking out a living in a brothel.</font>

141
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everything you have now</font>

142
00:08:01,760 --> 00:08:03,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was granted by me.</font>

143
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For the sake of a man,</font>

144
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd forsake your identity
as the sacred maid?</font>

145
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling,</font>

146
00:08:39,920 --> 00:08:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sorry.</font>

147
00:08:42,680 --> 00:08:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I cannot defy the Grandlord's command.</font>

148
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much longer will you control me?</font>

149
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

150
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:18,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's there?</font>

151
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After them!</font>

152
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:22,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone must have seen me kill him.</font>

153
00:09:23,160 --> 00:09:23,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Halt!</font>

154
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go after them.</font>

155
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Over there!</font>

156
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:32,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- After them!
- Quickly!</font>

157
00:09:34,520 --> 00:09:35,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

158
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:10,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Grandlord!</font>

159
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Grandlord has been killed!</font>

160
00:10:13,760 --> 00:10:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Wei, the Fourth Prince's sister,</font>

161
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:16,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tried to assassinate the Grandlord,</font>

162
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">offending the deity.</font>

163
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She has treacherous intent.</font>

164
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:20,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Capture her at once!</font>

165
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:21,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she resists,</font>

166
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">execute her on the spot.</font>

167
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you waiting for?</font>

168
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, My Lady.</font>

169
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:07,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

170
00:11:08,040 --> 00:11:08,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

171
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:10,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

172
00:11:10,680 --> 00:11:11,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

173
00:11:13,280 --> 00:11:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're finally awake.</font>

174
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:16,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

175
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing here?</font>

176
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If not me,</font>

177
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:22,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who else would it be?</font>

178
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I waited outside the Sect all night.</font>

179
00:11:25,640 --> 00:11:26,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw the chaos inside</font>

180
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and knew you must be in trouble.</font>

181
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good thing I got there in time,</font>

182
00:11:30,160 --> 00:11:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or I wouldn't have been able
to save you.</font>

183
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:34,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My eyes...</font>

184
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I found you,</font>

185
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your eyes were already like this.</font>

186
00:11:39,280 --> 00:11:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Judging by the symptoms,</font>

187
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think it's the red eye disease.</font>

188
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Colorless and odorless.</font>

189
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:53,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji has no respect for me.</font>

190
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It must have been that bottle of potion.</font>

191
00:11:58,440 --> 00:11:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

192
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:00,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our guesses were right.</font>

193
00:12:01,520 --> 00:12:02,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The red eye disease</font>

194
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was indeed poison released by the Sect.</font>

195
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:06,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rest well tonight.</font>

196
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:08,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At first light tomorrow,</font>

197
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:10,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll go back and find Jiang Ying.</font>

198
00:12:11,280 --> 00:12:12,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then we can plan our next move.</font>

199
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:15,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

200
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

201
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're back at last.</font>

202
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:34,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you catch them?</font>

203
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They got away.</font>

204
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:42,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was Qin Wei.</font>

205
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do you know?</font>

206
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:46,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She dropped her token.</font>

207
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:47,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's become the very thing</font>

208
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that lets me identify her</font>

209
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:49,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as the Grandlord's killer.</font>

210
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:51,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I let her slip away.</font>

211
00:12:52,520 --> 00:12:53,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if she identifies you later?</font>

212
00:12:54,920 --> 00:12:56,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's all alone.</font>

213
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And now,</font>

214
00:12:58,040 --> 00:12:59,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she's branded the Grandlord's killer.</font>

215
00:13:00,160 --> 00:13:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who would believe a word she says?</font>

216
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:03,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides,</font>

217
00:13:04,560 --> 00:13:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she knocked over the poison I'd hidden.</font>

218
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:08,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's bound to catch
the red eye disease.</font>

219
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:09,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The poison?</font>

220
00:13:13,360 --> 00:13:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch out.</font>

221
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This poison is highly contagious.</font>

222
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One touch can get you infected.</font>

223
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's there to fear?</font>

224
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:22,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you have the antidote?</font>

225
00:13:23,520 --> 00:13:25,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Grandlord was always paranoid.</font>

226
00:13:26,480 --> 00:13:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even what I possess</font>

227
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is only an incomplete prescription.</font>

228
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:31,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Incomplete?</font>

229
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:34,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The missing ingredient</font>

230
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:37,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must be added by the Grandlord
at the rite.</font>

231
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:39,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that the Grandlord is dead,</font>

232
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the red eye disease</font>

233
00:13:40,520 --> 00:13:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has truly become an incurable illness.</font>

234
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling,</font>

235
00:13:46,560 --> 00:13:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you are all I have left now.</font>

236
00:13:48,400 --> 00:13:49,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You absolutely must not come to harm.</font>

237
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:04,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Wanted]</font>

238
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:04,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Halt!</font>

239
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:07,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

240
00:14:07,880 --> 00:14:08,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

241
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:10,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Halt!</font>

242
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No. Go.</font>

243
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

244
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:27,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji is utterly despicable.</font>

245
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:28,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She killed the Grandlord.</font>

246
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And now she's framing you for it.</font>

247
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:31,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The rumors are spreading like wildfire.</font>

248
00:14:32,440 --> 00:14:33,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The city is being searched everywhere.</font>

249
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:35,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are still spies in the residence.</font>

250
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need to find a place to hide.</font>

251
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:38,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

252
00:14:40,640 --> 00:14:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Careful.</font>

253
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This way, this way.</font>

254
00:14:58,320 --> 00:15:00,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji.</font>

255
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:02,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me back my life!</font>

256
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:04,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji.</font>

257
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's there?</font>

258
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:21,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

259
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing here?</font>

260
00:15:27,640 --> 00:15:28,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was worried about you.</font>

261
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:32,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

262
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:34,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You had a nightmare?</font>

263
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:37,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I dreamed of the Grandlord.</font>

264
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have they caught Qin Wei?</font>

265
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:43,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've sent the Sect guards to search.</font>

266
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:45,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They will find her.</font>

267
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:47,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

268
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not that simple.</font>

269
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:51,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That wretch is cunning and sly.</font>

270
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone must be hiding her.</font>

271
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must also watch
the Prince's Residence.</font>

272
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

273
00:15:58,480 --> 00:15:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Until she is caught,</font>

274
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will not have a moment's peace.</font>

275
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:03,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are the only one I can trust now.</font>

276
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:05,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you lead</font>

277
00:16:06,560 --> 00:16:07,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the search yourself?</font>

278
00:16:11,640 --> 00:16:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

279
00:16:23,880 --> 00:16:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't want corn,</font>

280
00:16:24,800 --> 00:16:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll finish it all myself.</font>

281
00:16:28,560 --> 00:16:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine, don't eat then.</font>

282
00:16:29,400 --> 00:16:30,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That face you're making now</font>

283
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:32,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is only fit for bitter melon.</font>

284
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just feel</font>

285
00:16:36,560 --> 00:16:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so utterly useless.</font>

286
00:16:39,280 --> 00:16:40,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not only did I catch
the red eye disease,</font>

287
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:42,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but the Sect guards found out,</font>

288
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I got branded a murderer.</font>

289
00:16:46,680 --> 00:16:47,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And now,</font>

290
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've dragged you into hiding with me.</font>

291
00:16:50,440 --> 00:16:50,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

292
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you were never like this before.</font>

293
00:16:53,280 --> 00:16:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back in Beiyuan,</font>

294
00:16:54,640 --> 00:16:56,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you were brave and solved every case.</font>

295
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:58,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were the best coroner we had.</font>

296
00:16:59,680 --> 00:17:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you suddenly turn</font>

297
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into such a sentimental, fragile maiden?</font>

298
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

299
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:05,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since when was I the best coroner?</font>

300
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just a moment ago.</font>

301
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I appointed you myself.</font>

302
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's that saying?</font>

303
00:17:11,320 --> 00:17:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The boat will straighten at the bridge.</font>

304
00:17:13,120 --> 00:17:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fill your belly before facing trouble.</font>

305
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know?</font>

306
00:17:16,120 --> 00:17:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rest up and gather your strength.</font>

307
00:17:17,480 --> 00:17:18,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A solution will always come.</font>

308
00:17:19,480 --> 00:17:19,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat a little.</font>

309
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Grandlord is dead.</font>

310
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Regardless</font>

311
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of the conspiracy behind it,</font>

312
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:36,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right now,</font>

313
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Chengtian Sect is without a leader.</font>

314
00:17:40,760 --> 00:17:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must contact Ying asap.</font>

315
00:17:42,760 --> 00:17:44,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The only one who can help us now</font>

316
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the Great Emperor of Xizhao.</font>

317
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:47,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your top priority right now</font>

318
00:17:47,080 --> 00:17:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is to heal your eyes.</font>

319
00:17:48,520 --> 00:17:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will find a way to reach Ying</font>

320
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and send her word of your safety.</font>

321
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:54,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you must be careful.</font>

322
00:17:55,080 --> 00:17:56,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can rest assured.</font>

323
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't been listed</font>

324
00:17:57,280 --> 00:17:59,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the suspect register yet.</font>

325
00:17:59,840 --> 00:18:00,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be fine.</font>

326
00:18:01,360 --> 00:18:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You stay put here.</font>

327
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't go anywhere.</font>

328
00:18:05,080 --> 00:18:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you hear me?</font>

329
00:18:09,280 --> 00:18:10,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Finish your corn.</font>

330
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:45,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

331
00:18:46,750 --> 00:18:48,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

332
00:18:48,420 --> 00:18:51,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

333
00:18:52,340 --> 00:18:56,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

334
00:18:57,030 --> 00:19:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

335
00:19:01,010 --> 00:19:05,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

336
00:19:05,530 --> 00:19:09,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

337
00:19:09,870 --> 00:19:15,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

338
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:22,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

339
00:19:22,670 --> 00:19:26,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

340
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:31,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

341
00:19:31,270 --> 00:19:34,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

342
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:39,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

343
00:19:39,850 --> 00:19:43,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
